	(text "Our adapter: a GND between VOUT and VCLK, short runs away from the\nstepper wires, decoupling on VDD at the sensor, never hot-plugged.\nLight: two fibers on the connector's optical port (an LED, planned)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "00d1a06e-1e09-40c5-922f-331e6daaf6f9")
	)
	(text "Micro switches KFC-W-13W / KFC-C-15A. K: triggered while\nthe key is open (manual_stepper axis_k, ^PA2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "41b43edc-7c7d-43dc-bf3b-29a46275daed")
	)
	(text "Software I2C on the Aux Pico (gpio4/5), 0x68.\nVCC from the Pico's 3V3: to confirm.\nPlanned: an ADXL345 on a toolhead MCU instead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.39 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4a19b9da-66c7-47d7-b12b-48cec07e6376")
	)
	(text "5 V + GND + data only (12 V stays motion-only).\nID (ADC, read by the plot bed board), EN, PWM\n+ 2 spare (UART/I2C, or the Pi Zero's USB). Tethered tools: their own supply, EN/PWM\nthrough an isolator. A toolhead MCU (K, its endstop,\nADXL345, HX711, lock sensor) is planned with it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "79c20044-f1b4-4242-a10e-4350a6a78e46")
	)
	(text "Z and K: 4 wires each in silicone ribbons, from the Melzi's\nX and Z ports (sheet Melzi), drivers at ~7.5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
